sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Merchant
    participant Product
    participant Version as ProductVersion
    participant Variant as ProductVariant
    participant Offer as ProductVariantVersion
    participant Inventory

    Merchant->>Product: Create product identity for Store
    Product-->>Merchant: Product created with no current published version
    Merchant->>Version: Create first version for Product
    Version-->>Merchant: Version created in DRAFT
    Merchant->>Version: Set name, description, category, and media references

    loop For each sellable variation
        Merchant->>Variant: Create stable variant identity under Product
        Merchant->>Offer: Create DRAFT offer for Variant and Version
        Offer->>Offer: Record SKU, display name, and Money price
        alt Ownership identifiers do not match
            Offer-->>Merchant: Throw OwnershipMismatchException
            Note over Product,Offer: Reject association without lifecycle mutation
        else Ownership identifiers match
            Merchant->>Variant: Initialize inventory with non-negative quantity
            alt Inventory already exists or quantity is negative
                Variant-->>Merchant: Reject inventory initialization
                Note over Variant,Inventory: Publication state remains unchanged
            else Inventory invariant passes
                Variant->>Inventory: Create the one Inventory record
                Inventory-->>Merchant: Inventory initialized independently
            end
        end
    end

    Merchant->>Version: submitForReview(active variants, offers)
    Version->>Version: Verify source state is DRAFT
    alt Version is not DRAFT
        Version-->>Merchant: Throw IllegalLifecycleTransitionException
        Note over Version,Offer: Parent and children remain unchanged
    else Version is DRAFT
        Version->>Version: Validate name, description, and category
        Version->>Offer: Validate ownership and at least one active offer
        Offer->>Offer: Validate non-blank unique SKUs and positive Money prices
        alt Any readiness rule fails
            Offer-->>Version: Return stable readiness failure reason
            Version-->>Merchant: Throw ProductReadinessException
            %% Note over Version,Offer: Full preflight prevents partial transition; all remain DRAFT
        else Full aggregate is ready
            Offer-->>Version: Readiness preflight succeeds
            Version->>Offer: Move every included eligible offer to IN_REVIEW
            Version->>Version: Move ProductVersion to IN_REVIEW
            Version-->>Merchant: Submission accepted
        end
    end

    Merchant->>Product: publish(version, offers)
    Product->>Version: Verify version ownership and IN_REVIEW state
    Version->>Offer: Preflight ownership and IN_REVIEW state for every included offer
    alt Ownership or lifecycle validation fails
        Offer-->>Version: Return validation failure
        Version-->>Product: Abort publication
        Product-->>Merchant: Throw domain exception
        Note over Product,Offer: Version, offers, and currentPublishedVersionId remain unchanged
    else Every publication precondition succeeds
        Offer-->>Version: Publication preflight succeeds
        Version->>Offer: Move all included offers to PUBLISHED
        Product->>Version: Move ProductVersion to PUBLISHED
        Product->>Product: Set currentPublishedVersionId
        Product-->>Merchant: First complete version published
    end
